// Bun Snapshot v1, https://bun.sh/docs/test/snapshots

exports[`marketing templates snapshots 1`] = `
{
  "name": "welcome",
  "subject": "Welcome to convt",
  "text": 
"Convert any file with a right-click.

Thanks for making a convt account. convt converts images, video, audio and documents on your own computer, so your files never get uploaded.

1. Download the app
   convt runs on macOS, Windows and Linux. Every format works offline.
2. Right-click any file
   Choose Convert with convt and pick a format. A HEIC photo becomes a JPG, a MOV becomes an MP4.
3. Or use the command line
   The same engine, for scripts and whole folders.

    convt photos/ --to jpeg -r

Download convt: https://convt.app/download

The app is free for 7 days from your first conversion. After that, Desktop is a one-time purchase with every future desktop update, or Pro adds cloud conversions from your phone or browser.

See every format: https://convt.app/formats

--
You're getting this because you have a convt account. Account and license emails, like sign-in codes and keys, still arrive if you unsubscribe.
Email preferences: {{preferencesUrl}}
Unsubscribe: {{unsubscribeUrl}}
convt · 1 Example Street, Test City
"
,
}
`;

