{
  "name": "lifetime-desktop",
  "subject": "Your convt Desktop license is now lifetime",
  "text": 
"Your Desktop license is now lifetime.

When you bought convt Desktop, it came with a year of updates. We've changed that for everyone who paid: a Desktop license now includes every future desktop update, with no renewal.

You don't need to do anything.
Your current license key keeps working and now counts as lifetime. Every future desktop update works with it.

- Every format, offline
- Every future desktop update
- Batch folders and presets
- No subscription for the desktop app

View your license: https://convt.app/dashboard/licenses

Thank you for buying convt early. If anything about your license looks wrong, tell us and we'll fix it.

