exports[`marketing templates snapshots 3`] = `
{
  "name": "pro-trial",
  "subject": "Getting started with convt Pro",
  "text": 
"Your Pro trial has started.

For the next 7 days you have everything in convt Pro. Here's how to get the most out of it.

1. Sign in on your computer
   Open Settings in the convt app and choose Sign in with convt.app. Pro turns on for that computer.
2. Convert from your phone or browser
   Upload a file from any device and download the result. Files are deleted after 24 hours.
3. Send heavy video to the cloud
   Long exports run on our servers when you choose, so your laptop stays free.

Open your dashboard: https://convt.app/dashboard

We'll email you before the trial ends. You can cancel any time from Billing, and nothing is charged until then.

Manage your plan: https://convt.app/dashboard/billing

--
You're getting this because you have a convt account. Account and license emails, like sign-in codes and keys, still arrive if you unsubscribe.
Email preferences: {{preferencesUrl}}
Unsubscribe: {{unsubscribeUrl}}
convt · 1 Example Street, Test City
"
,
}
`;

