eef7f2;border:1px solid #cfe6d9;font-size:13px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;font-weight:600;color:#127a47">3</div></td><td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 16px"><p class="ink" style="margin:2px 0 2px;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#0a0a0a">Or use the command line</p><p class="ink2" style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:#6b6f6d">The same engine, for scripts and whole folders.</p></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:#0f1211;color:#e6e8e7;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:20px">convt photos/ --to jpeg -r</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tr><td style="border-radius:10px;background:#16935a;background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,#1fb36c,#14864f)"><a href="https://convt.app/download" style="display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;font-size:15px;line-height:18px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:10px">Download convt</a></td></tr></table><p class="ink2" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#6b6f6d">The app is free for 7 days from your first conversion. After that, Desktop is a one-time purchase with every future desktop update, or Pro adds cloud conversions from your phone or browser.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px"><a class="link" href="https://convt.app/formats" style="color:#127a47;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">See every format &rarr;</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:22px 8px 0"><p class="ink3" style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6c716e">You&#39;re getting this because you have a convt account. Account and license emails, like sign-in codes and keys, still arrive if you unsubscribe.</p><p class="ink3" style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6c716e"><a class="link" href="{{preferencesUrl}}" style="color:#6c